<div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Find an order</span>
  </nav>
</div>

<section class="wrap wrap-narrow" style="padding-bottom:clamp(60px,8vw,110px)">
  <span class="eyebrow">Order lookup</span>
  <h1 style="margin:14px 0 18px">Find your order</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Enter the order number from your confirmation email. Add the email address you ordered with
    to reveal the full delivery address.
  </p>

  <form class="panel" data-order-lookup style="margin-top:36px" novalidate>
    <div class="form-grid">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="orderNumber">Order number</label>
        <input class="input" type="text" id="orderNumber" name="orderNumber" placeholder="CY-20260214-0001" required />
        <span class="hint">It looks like CY-YYYYMMDD-0001 and is in your confirmation email.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="email">Email <span class="hint">(optional)</span></label>
        <input class="input" type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit">Find my order</button>
    </div>
  </form>

  <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:44px;gap:26px">
    <div class="pillar">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <h4>Where is my parcel?</h4>
      <p>Tracking is emailed the moment your parcel is scanned by the carrier. Domestic delivery takes
        2–5 business days, international 7–14.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <span class="num">02</span>
      <h4>Something wrong with the tea?</h4>
      <p>Tell us. If a tea is not to your taste we will replace it or refund it — that is the whole
        policy, and you do not need to send it back.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
